        "[F]Take it [C7]to the [F]Lord in prayer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Are we weak [Bb]and heavy laden,",
        "[F]Cumbered with a [C]load of care?",
        "[F]Precious Savior, [Bb]still our refuge",
        "[F]Take it [C7]to the [F]Lord in prayer.",
        "[C]Do your [C7]friends despise, [F]forsake you?",
        "[Bb]Take it [F]to the [C]Lord in prayer.",
        "[F]In his arms he'll [Bb]take and shield you;",
